</div>

<!-- DOCUMENTATION PANEL -->
<div class="docs-overlay" id="docsOverlay" onclick="toggleDocs()"></div>
<div class="docs-panel" id="docsPanel">
  <button class="docs-close" onclick="toggleDocs()">✕</button>

  <div class="docs-title">How This Was Built</div>

  <div class="docs-section">
    <div class="docs-section-title">System Prompt Design</div>
    <div class="docs-content">
      The assistant is designed as a <strong>mental health support specialist</strong> with clinical knowledge and empathetic communication. Key features:
      <br/><br/>
      • <strong>Role:</strong> Compassionate support specialist with psychology background<br/>
      • <strong>Scope:</strong> Stress, anxiety, emotional challenges (not crisis intervention)<br/>
      • <strong>Tone:</strong> Professional warmth, validation-first approach<br/>
      • <strong>Constraints:</strong> No diagnosis, encourages professional help when needed<br/>
      • <strong>Techniques:</strong> Active listening, CBT strategies, grounding exercises
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="docs-section">
    <div class="docs-section-title">UI/UX Decisions</div>
    <div class="docs-content">
      • <strong>Conversational Interface:</strong> Chat-based for natural dialogue<br/>
      • <strong>Minimalist Design:</strong> Reduces cognitive load for stressed users<br/>
